WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.592
Never send model-generated arguments directly to a real function.

00:00:04.592 --> 00:00:11.872
First validate the schema, then check whether the user is authorized, then apply any business rules,

00:00:11.872 --> 00:00:14.512
and only then execute the tool.

00:00:14.512 --> 00:00:22.513
The L L M can suggest an action, but it must not be the component that grants itself permission to perform that action.
